// # Dispatch oodac commands
//
// Logline: Parse argv and run build, emit, check, tokens, ast, outline, reflect, run, or a backend emit.
//
// Setup: Command line arguments and compiler options are parsed for command dispatch.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Unpack cmd, path, out, backend, and flag bits from parse_cli_argv.
//   2. build, emit-c family, and check run their drivers (cap-nm probes as flagged).
//   3. tokens, ast, outline, reflect, run, and emit-bc/wasm/llvm/x86 load source; unknown cmd exits 2.

